  - speaker: 1
    kind: 0
    text: "You can just give them to me; I\u2019ll eat them if you won\u2019t."
    videoEventId: 
  - speaker: 0
    kind: 0
    text: "That\u2019d be cool yeah, wouldn\u2019t want to throw them away. Oh, right,
      what\u2019d you get for question number seven by the way? I think I fucked
      up the formula on that one\u2026"
    videoEventId: 
  - speaker: 1
    kind: 0
    text: "I\u2019ve got 120.39"
    videoEventId: 
  - speaker: 0
    kind: 0
    text: "Ah shit, I somehow ended up with 56.70. Oh well, there goes my A. And
      I even studied a lot this time\u2026 "
    videoEventId: 
  - speaker: 1
    kind: 0
    text: 'If you want, I can help you a bit after school, we could so a little study-hangout.  '
    videoEventId: 
  - speaker: 2
    kind: 2
    text: 'Your head is ringing from all the information you gathered, listening
